  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When picking up an object in Desktop mode, the right hand sometimes becomes locked in place. Attempting to move the right arm using Direct Arm Control causes the hand to shake rapidly instead of moving normally.\n\nClicking to pick up the object a second time sometimes resolves the issue, allowing the player to freely move their right arm while holding the object.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\nLaunch VRChat in Desktop mode with Direct Arm Control enabled.\n\nPick up an object with the right hand.\n\nAttempt to move the right arm using the middle mouse button.\n\nObserve the hand shaking while remaining in place.\n\nClick to pick up the object again.\n\nExpected behavior: The player should be able to freely move their arm while holding an object.\n\nActual behavior: The right hand sometimes shakes and remains locked in place until the object is picked up again.\n\nFrequency: Intermittent.",
